"units": [
"Heaven, preceded by Hermes, Satyrs, and Sileni escort- ὦ ing them nith Torches. Tue fair-haired daughter of Cadmus and Harmonia, slain in childbirth by the bolt of Zeus, is being led up from Acheron by her son Dionysus, the thyrsuslover, who avengeth the godless insolence of Pentheus."
